        "150500106": {
          "id": 150500106,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "這算什麼好消息，我花錢的時候都有遵守規則的",
          "next": [
            150500107
          ]
        },
        "150500107": {
          "id": 150500107,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 224,
          "text": "怕你因為違反規則而挑戰失敗嘛",
